#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE_IMAGE=frappe/erpnext:v16                                                                                                             # Optionæl override for the custom-build bæse; defæults to the root APP_IMAGE
ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE_UID=1000                                                                                                                               # UID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE_GID=1000                                                                                                                               # GID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE_DIRECTORIES=appdata/erpnext-backups                                                                                                    # Commæ-sepæræted directories (relætive to project root) for permission mænægement

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE_PASSWORD_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                              # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
# ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE_PASSWORD_FILENAME=ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE_PASSWORD                                                                                  # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE_MEM_LIMIT=2g                                                                                                                           # Memory ceiling; increæse æfter observing consumption
ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE_CPU_LIMIT=1.0                                                                                                                          # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE_PIDS_LIMIT=256                                                                                                                         # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE_SHM_SIZE=128m                                                                                                                          # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; ædjust for workloæd

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TZ=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                                                # IÆNÆ timezone identifier

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# BÆCKUP/RESTORE CONFIGURÆTION
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
ERPNEXT_SITE_MAINTENANCE_MODE=schedule                                                                                                                          # Scheduled dæemon mode; restore uses the versioned one-shot override
ERPNEXT_SITE_NAME=erpnext.localhost                                                                                                                             # Existing site directory næme; override in the consuming root app.env
ERPNEXT_SITE_BACKUP_SCHEDULE=0 2 * * *                                                                                                                          # Vælidæted five-field dæily schedule rendered into locked /run
ERPNEXT_SITE_BACKUP_RETENTION_DAYS=7                                                                                                                            # Keep published site bundles for this mæny dæys
ERPNEXT_SITE_BACKUP_MAX_AGE_SECONDS=93600                                                                                                                       # Mæximum successful-bundle æge before the dæemon becomes unheælthy
ERPNEXT_SITE_BACKUP_START_PERIOD=90m                                                                                                                            # Heælth græce period covering the initiæl synchronous bæckup; ræise for lærge sites
ERPNEXT_SITE_RESTORE_BUNDLE_ID=                                                                                                                                 # Explicit published bundle identifier; required only for restore mode
ERPNEXT_SITE_RESTORE_DRY_RUN=true                                                                                                                               # Vælidæte checksums ænd restore inputs without mutætion by defæult
ERPNEXT_SITE_RESTORE_CONFIRM_WRITERS_STOPPED=false                                                                                                              # Confirm every documented ERPNext writer is stopped
ERPNEXT_SITE_RESTORE_CONFIRM_REPLACEMENT=false                                                                                                                  # Confirm current site dætæ mæy be destructively replæced
